sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as Frontend UI
    participant ChatAPI as Chat API
    participant DiagramAPI as Diagram API
    participant LangChain as LangChain Orchestrator
    participant LLM as LLM Provider
    participant DB as Database
    participant Stream as Stream Handler

    User->>UI: Request design change via chat
    UI->>ChatAPI: POST /api/conversations/{id}/messages
    ChatAPI->>DB: Store user message
    ChatAPI->>LangChain: Process design feedback
    LangChain->>DB: Retrieve project context
    LangChain->>LLM: Generate design update via Stream
    LLM-->>Stream: Stream response chunks
    Stream-->>UI: Stream assistant response
    UI-->>User: Display streaming response
    
    LLM-->>LangChain: Complete final response
    LangChain->>DiagramAPI: Update diagram if needed
    DiagramAPI->>DB: Store updated diagram version
    DB-->>DiagramAPI: Return updated asset
    DiagramAPI-->>LangChain: Confirm update
    LangChain-->>ChatAPI: Complete conversation update
    ChatAPI->>DB: Store assistant message
    UI->>DiagramAPI: GET /api/projects/{id}/assets/{assetId}
    DiagramAPI-->>UI: Return updated diagram
    UI-->>User: Display updated diagram
